{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1693","id":4118597467,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p871fM9b","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1693","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1693.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1693.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1693","number":1693,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] finalize 9709 structural production Batch016","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1692.\n\nProgram authority: #1649. Exact predecessor merge SHA: `4f7ff04257fc1ae110aa0473a41c1a4c85b53197`.\n\n## What changed\n\nThis PR completes structural production Batch016, the final frozen complete-paper batch in the 9709 upstream program. It freezes and verifies 27 official QP/MS paper pairs and 221 admitted questions, preserves the single observed boundary sentinel (`9709_w25_qp_15_q11`) as an explicit unpromoted source observation, and keeps all duplicate or failed-attempt namespaces at admission zero.\n\nThe batch imports exact candidate-blind AO checker custody for 221 primary reads and 172 required high-risk second reads. Deterministic reconciliation preserves 219 checker disagreements and two maker safe-rejection histories without silent overwrite. Four independent source-only resolver lanes are authenticated against their exact terminal, record-set, packet-manifest, packet-set, and per-record hashes; the corrected shard-01 validation v2 is admitted while its preserved v1 false-positive is explicitly excluded.\n\nFinal artifact-only staging contains 221 `resolver_verified` rows. The terminal conservation equation is `221 = 221 resolver_verified + 0 verified_agreement + 0 safe_rejection + 0 conflict + 0 unresolved`. False accepts, false overrides, candidate-only verified rows, silent disagreement resolutions, validation errors, missing provenance, and downstream writes are all zero.\n\n## Root cause and effect\n\nBatch016 spans the end-of-inventory boundary, where the navigation-derived QP observation population contains one more printed header than the frozen eligible question population. Treating navigation discovery as membership authority would have silently widened the batch. The implementation instead binds membership to the frozen inventory admitted prefix and records the extra observation as a source-bound exclusion sentinel. Resolver import similarly normalizes only terminal receipt transport dialects; substantive resolver decisions remain immutable and source-derived.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — PASS before implementation\n- Batch016 pre-provider tests — 3/3 PASS\n- Batch016 reconciliation tests — 5/5 PASS\n- Batch016 final-resolution tests — 9/9 PASS\n- Batch015 predecessor regressions — 22/22 PASS\n- Batch014 predecessor regressions — 14/14 PASS\n- Python bytecode compilation for all Batch016 runners — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- Deterministic finalization replay — byte-identical, with zero repeated provider, maker, checker, or resolver calls\n\nNo paid/external VLM calls, semantic enrichment, KG construction, canonical/production/public promotion, or downstream mutation were performed.\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T17:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T17:55:03Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T17:55:03Z","merged_at":"2026-07-23T17:55:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"c1d610380653b793e9e6a43f220e703846c2160d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1693/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1693/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1693/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a4ac535b4612b1cca4b8073da6503e439c3034fc","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1692-9709-full-corpus-structural-production-batch-016","ref":"task/1692-9709-full-corpus-structural-production-batch-016","sha":"a4ac535b4612b1cca4b8073da6503e439c3034fc","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us